zde = z3x + CASH_READ_LEFT 6000 + DELIVER_FAR (new switch; DELIVER_FAR 9, DELIVER_FAR_WAIT 30, DELIVER_FAR_BANK 200). Built from bots/zc9 with RUSH_FROM set back to 4 (zc9's only other difference from z3x + CASH_READ_LEFT). A rat whose part load (DELIVER_IDLE 10 to DELIVER_AT 30) would go home only under the idle-trip rule (no pile in sight, not late) holds it at its mine instead while the nearest king is 9 or more away (Chebyshev), the load is under 30 rounds old, the bank holds 200 and, at war, no enemy is in view (Baby.farHold; Baby.loadSince tracks the load's start).
